   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">BII have invested $98m in a c. $300m partnership with IndiGrid and Norfund to bid and develop greenfield transmission and Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) projects in India. IndiGrid is India&#x2019;s largest publicly listed transmission sector focused Infrastructure Investment Trust (&#x201C;InvIT&#x201D;) in India backed by KKR and GIC. The transaction is structured uniquely with an assured buy-out of BII and Norfund&#x2019;s investment by IndiGrid post commissioning of constructed assets. The assured exit structure ensures mobilisation of commercial capital into the transmission sector in India.</narrative>
   </description>
